uplink-boombox-name = Boombox
uplink-boombox-desc = Bluespaces a portable jukebox in. Set an appropriately catastrophic tune and go on a rampage!

uplink-boxmags-name = L6 SAW magazine box
uplink-boxmags-desc = Magazine box fitting for L6 SAW, using .30 cartridge.

uplink-demonic-scripture-name = Heaven-Devouring Demonic Scripture
uplink-demonic-scripture-desc = A forbidden cultivation scripture from a sect wiped out for practising it. Reading it awakens you as a cultivator and teaches the Demonic Path: devour corpses, plant gu worms, search souls, puppet the dead, escape in a spray of blood and strike the Five-Point Exploding Heart Palm. You can pass the arts to disciples, but they can't pass them on. Anyone with Spiritual Sense will smell it on you.

uplink-ks-space-alligator-cube-name = Alligator Cube
uplink-ks-space-alligator-cube-desc = A dehydrated space alligator. Add water and it grows into a full-sized one that drags people down and tears their legs off. It is nobody's friend, yours included.
